$ govctl check --help
Validate all governed documents

Usage: govctl check [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -C, --config <CONFIG>  Path to govctl config (TOML)
  -W, --deny-warnings    Treat warnings as errors
      --dry-run          Dry run: preview changes without writing files
  -h, --help             Print help

EXAMPLES:
    govctl check
    govctl check -W

NOTES:
    - `-W/--deny-warnings` treats warnings as errors.
exit: 0
